{
  "uid": "facil-inspections",
  "title": "Facil — Inspections terrain (mobile inspector)",
  "tags": [
    "facil",
    "inspections",
    "field",
    "mobile",
    "OMS"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 38,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "5m",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-90d",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "editable": false,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "links": [
    {
      "type": "dashboards",
      "tags": [
        "facil"
      ],
      "title": "Facil dashboards",
      "asDropdown": true,
      "includeVars": true,
      "keepTime": true,
      "icon": "external link"
    }
  ],
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "entity",
        "label": "Entité",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "postgres",
          "uid": "facil-postgres"
        },
        "query": "SELECT DISTINCT entity_code FROM v_field_inspections_enriched WHERE entity_code IS NOT NULL ORDER BY entity_code",
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        },
        "refresh": 1
      },
      {
        "name": "city",
        "label": "Ville",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "postgres",
          "uid": "facil-postgres"
        },
        "query": "SELECT DISTINCT location_city FROM v_field_inspections_enriched WHERE location_city IS NOT NULL ORDER BY location_city",
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        },
        "refresh": 1
      },
      {
        "name": "result",
        "label": "Résultat",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "postgres",
          "uid": "facil-postgres"
        },
        "query": "SELECT DISTINCT result FROM v_field_inspections_enriched WHERE result IS NOT NULL ORDER BY result",
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        },
        "refresh": 1
      }
    ]
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 99,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Statut",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 3
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "> ℹ️ **Aucune inspection terrain enregistrée à ce jour.** Les KPIs et tables s'alimenteront automatiquement dès que des inspecteurs effectuent des inspections via l'app **Facil Inspector** (mobile). Les colonnes prêtes : **inspection_date, status, result, conforme, mise_en_demeure_issued, seal_applied, payment_collected, payment_amount, photos, gps_latitude, gps_longitude, duration_minutes**."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Volume + résultats",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Inspections totales",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "postgres",
        "uid": "facil-postgres"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 4
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "graphMode": "area"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "format": "table",
          "rawSql": "SELECT count(*) FROM v_field_inspections_enriched WHERE inspection_date BETWEEN $__timeFrom() AND $__timeTo() AND entity_code IN (${entity:sqlstring}) AND COALESCE(location_city, 'unassigned') IN (${city:sqlstring}) AND COALESCE(result, 'unknown') IN (${result:sqlstring})"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "noValue": "0"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Conformes",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "postgres",
        "uid": "facil-postgres"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 4,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 4
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "green"
          },
          "noValue": "0"
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "graphMode": "none"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "format": "table",
          "rawSql": "SELECT count(*) FILTER (WHERE activity_conforme = true) FROM v_field_inspections_enriched WHERE inspection_date BETWEEN $__timeFrom() AND $__timeTo() AND entity_code IN (${entity:sqlstring})"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Non-conformes",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "postgres",
        "uid": "facil-postgres"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 8,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 4
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "red"
          },
          "noValue": "0"
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "graphMode": "none"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "format": "table",
          "rawSql": "SELECT count(*) FILTER (WHERE activity_conforme = false) FROM v_field_inspections_enriched WHERE inspection_date BETWEEN $__timeFrom() AND $__timeTo() AND entity_code IN (${entity:sqlstring})"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Mises en demeure",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "postgres",
        "uid": "facil-postgres"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 4
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "orange"
          },
          "noValue": "0"
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "graphMode": "none"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "format": "table",
          "rawSql": "SELECT count(*) FILTER (WHERE mise_en_demeure_issued = true) FROM v_field_inspections_enriched WHERE inspection_date BETWEEN $__timeFrom() AND $__timeTo() AND entity_code IN (${entity:sqlstring})"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Scellés appliqués",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "postgres",
        "uid": "facil-postgres"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 16,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 4
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "red"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 1
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 5
              }
            ]
          },
          "noValue": "0"
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "graphMode": "none",
        "colorMode": "background"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "format": "table",
          "rawSql": "SELECT count(*) FILTER (WHERE seal_applied = true) FROM v_field_inspections_enriched WHERE inspection_date BETWEEN $__timeFrom() AND $__timeTo() AND entity_code IN (${entity:sqlstring})"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Encaissement terrain (XAF)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "postgres",
        "uid": "facil-postgres"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 20,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 4
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "currency:XAF",
          "noValue": "0"
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "graphMode": "area"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "format": "table",
          "rawSql": "SELECT COALESCE(SUM(payment_amount) FILTER (WHERE payment_collected = true), 0) FROM v_field_inspections_enriched WHERE inspection_date BETWEEN $__timeFrom() AND $__timeTo() AND entity_code IN (${entity:sqlstring})"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Distribution / résultat",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "piechart",
      "title": "Résultats inspections",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "postgres",
        "uid": "facil-postgres"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 9,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 8
      },
      "options": {
        "pieType": "donut",
        "displayLabels": [
          "name",
          "percent"
        ],
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "format": "table",
          "rawSql": "SELECT COALESCE(result, '(en cours)') AS result, count(*) AS n FROM v_field_inspections_enriched WHERE inspection_date BETWEEN $__timeFrom() AND $__timeTo() AND entity_code IN (${entity:sqlstring}) GROUP BY result ORDER BY n DESC"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "barchart",
      "title": "Inspections par ville (top 15)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "postgres",
        "uid": "facil-postgres"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 8,
        "y": 9,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 8
      },
      "options": {
        "orientation": "horizontal"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "format": "table",
          "rawSql": "SELECT COALESCE(location_city, '(non assigné)') AS city, count(*) AS n FROM v_field_inspections_enriched WHERE inspection_date BETWEEN $__timeFrom() AND $__timeTo() AND entity_code IN (${entity:sqlstring}) GROUP BY location_city ORDER BY n DESC LIMIT 15"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "type": "barchart",
      "title": "Top inspecteurs (volume + conformité)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "postgres",
        "uid": "facil-postgres"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 16,
        "y": 9,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "format": "table",
          "rawSql": "SELECT COALESCE(agent_full_name, agent_email, '?') AS agent, count(*) AS \"Volume\", count(*) FILTER (WHERE activity_conforme = true) AS \"Conformes\", count(*) FILTER (WHERE seal_applied = true) AS \"Scellés\" FROM v_field_inspections_enriched WHERE inspection_date BETWEEN $__timeFrom() AND $__timeTo() AND entity_code IN (${entity:sqlstring}) GROUP BY agent_full_name, agent_email ORDER BY \"Volume\" DESC LIMIT 10"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Évolution + Encaissement",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 17,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Inspections quotidiennes (résultats)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "postgres",
        "uid": "facil-postgres"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 18,
        "w": 16,
        "h": 8
      },
      "options": {
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        },
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "format": "time_series",
          "rawSql": "SELECT inspection_date AS time, count(*) FILTER (WHERE activity_conforme = true) AS \"Conformes\", count(*) FILTER (WHERE activity_conforme = false) AS \"Non-conformes\", count(*) FILTER (WHERE seal_applied = true) AS \"Scellés\" FROM v_field_inspections_enriched WHERE inspection_date BETWEEN $__timeFrom() AND $__timeTo() AND entity_code IN (${entity:sqlstring}) GROUP BY inspection_date ORDER BY inspection_date"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Encaissement quotidien (XAF)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "postgres",
        "uid": "facil-postgres"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 16,
        "y": 18,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "currency:XAF"
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "format": "time_series",
          "rawSql": "SELECT inspection_date AS time, COALESCE(SUM(payment_amount) FILTER (WHERE payment_collected = true), 0) AS \"Collecté\" FROM v_field_inspections_enriched WHERE inspection_date BETWEEN $__timeFrom() AND $__timeTo() AND entity_code IN (${entity:sqlstring}) GROUP BY inspection_date ORDER BY inspection_date"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Cartographie GPS (si dispo)",
      "collapsed": true,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 26,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "type": "geomap",
      "title": "Carte inspections",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "postgres",
        "uid": "facil-postgres"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 27,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 12
      },
      "options": {
        "view": {
          "id": "coords",
          "lat": 1.5,
          "lon": 10.5,
          "zoom": 7
        },
        "controls": {
          "showZoom": true,
          "showAttribution": false,
          "mouseWheelZoom": true
        },
        "layers": [
          {
            "type": "default",
            "name": "Tile"
          }
        ]
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "format": "table",
          "rawSql": "SELECT inspection_date, gps_latitude AS latitude, gps_longitude AS longitude, agent_full_name, result, payment_amount, seal_applied FROM v_field_inspections_enriched WHERE inspection_date BETWEEN $__timeFrom() AND $__timeTo() AND gps_latitude IS NOT NULL AND gps_longitude IS NOT NULL AND entity_code IN (${entity:sqlstring})"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 40,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Détails",
      "collapsed": true,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 39,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 41,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "100 dernières inspections",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "postgres",
        "uid": "facil-postgres"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 40,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 12
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Encaissé"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "currency:XAF"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "footer": {
          "enablePagination": true
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "format": "table",
          "rawSql": "SELECT inspection_date AS \"Date\", agent_full_name AS \"Inspecteur\", entity_code AS \"Entité\", location_city AS \"Ville\", status AS \"Statut\", result AS \"Résultat\", activity_conforme AS \"Conforme\", mise_en_demeure_issued AS \"MED\", seal_applied AS \"Scellé\", payment_collected AS \"Encaissement?\", payment_amount AS \"Encaissé\", duration_minutes AS \"Durée (min)\", photos_count AS \"Photos\" FROM v_field_inspections_enriched WHERE inspection_date BETWEEN $__timeFrom() AND $__timeTo() AND entity_code IN (${entity:sqlstring}) AND COALESCE(location_city, 'unassigned') IN (${city:sqlstring}) ORDER BY inspection_date DESC, created_at DESC LIMIT 100"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}